No quantity below has been computed yet; thresholds are predictions from hand arithmetic.

Notation. tau = pi, eps = 1.5, d = sqrt(2)|g|/lam, x = tau*d.
  psi_l = z_l = i h^(-1/2) a_l / sqrt(2) = i h^(3/2) exp(-eps h^2) u / sqrt(2),  e_l = k(psi_l), ||e_l|| = ||coth^(1/2) psi_l||.
  N3_hi  = sqrt( (1/2) sup_p[(p coth(pi p))^3 exp(-2 eps p^2)] ||u||^2 )           (certified upper bound for ||coth^(3/2) psi_l||)
  E_lo   = sqrt( A_inf exp(-2 eps G_hi^2/A_inf) / (2 pi) )                          (certified lower bound for ||e_l||, l >= 16)
  Rb     = N3_hi/E_lo,  C0 = (1/2)(1+Rb) pi^2
  proved remainder bound   rem_hi(l,g) = (1/2)(1+Rb)(e^x - 1 - x)   <= C0 e^x g^2/lam^2
  proved lower bound       low(l,g)    = c g/lam - rem_hi(l,g),  c = 2.110e-3 (EVEN-PASSAGE, recomputed here by its certified())
Fine grid: even-passage's discretisation, dy = 0.02, ytop = 40.  Coarse grid for operator norms: dy = 0.04.
l in {16, 64, 256, 1024} (required) plus 16384 (where the proved bound is predicted to be positive); g in {1, 8}.

